tbB74nSjz6FvVUENNZnc9uIgQvyWR4K8fBOv65JOm7PQT9kymw4PmBa2iak185OtSaj18lyb5N2bTiaVSrPiaGu3HmRGeCpS1qAAy1uhibzc%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nShP53IXzhwOm2WVkOmicm2C4wLOpwT4vbmKPp4W1LpictlqdI3c9hMOySp6fVWCAmuGSa6nicAASsNVibJg38meehxZjFTZqQakicEw%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nShMG7DkMdOSVY2cyhZMbD6xiaibL49j05j6ftL8kKGmXicQrUKfPeibvS9oypicEia1OwEBn83zkVu81icusUlQXtv8739Xr3q3Chaop8%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nShhF1nb0Hzm4U0d8LcgJiaCswWFUpibdkwrfxllibMCRTNJ1Sp5Zooel6817J5MKxR86RyFvSaO4JytOIfSTf9sYoDRUIbvBbbmxE%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nShKY6tA5kSPUiaLUk9797ywBSrkInkg6y8Xb2zmX0by4khUWUB6nbU4k2gia60X23icGNINCazVSV2nNWR3Ykz5ia7GNicEeQEMeRyU%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nSjXfVhcNVttpWyFcnIIt0Bpibg5yaLKRJm7wreEoyFkpW7O7Fmh9LU8TpaMEiaGQgTribKfBIZ5f919F9XpWldbzRxG7shZQia26HE%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-18T06:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497033:1","title":"两个 SOC 的故事：两次红队评估带来的启示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497033&idx=1&sn=3997f6d00b99ba091687c970c48b3ea2&chksm=9ab6114c12374718d7b870fb57f288335755cf4c0a52298ae0640c7ca0e848e66c639f767529&scene=126&sessionid=1795697936#rd","description":"CISA 拿两家单位做红队攻防测试，结果天差地别。\n\n两家都被打进了内网。但 A 家毫无察觉，B 家十分钟就掐断了攻击。\n\nA 家输在管理乱：告警满天飞，真攻击反而被淹没了。多个安全团队各看各的屏幕，谁也不通气。出事了连系统归谁管都不知道，只能干瞪眼。\n\nB 家赢在反应快：钓鱼邮件刚中招，十分钟就隔离了电脑。云上异常登录一触发，账号立马被封。不过 B 家底子也虚：明文密码、权限给太大、没开多因素认证，全被黑客钻了空子。\n\n真正该补的课：\n工具得调教：建好正常行为基线，过滤掉日常噪音。\n权责得划清：安全人员必须有权直接终端断网，不用层层请示。\n云和 OT 得盯紧：定期查查过大的应用权限和长期不换的密钥。\n\n说白了，光买一堆安全工具没用，关键得有人会用、敢处置。","content":"<p>CISA 拿两家单位做红队攻防测试，结果天差地别。<br /><br />两家都被打进了内网。但 A 家毫无察觉，B 家十分钟就掐断了攻击。<br /><br />A 家输在管理乱：告警满天飞，真攻击反而被淹没了。多个安全团队各看各的屏幕，谁也不通气。出事了连系统归谁管都不知道，只能干瞪眼。<br /><br />B 家赢在反应快：钓鱼邮件刚中招，十分钟就隔离了电脑。云上异常登录一触发，账号立马被封。不过 B 家底子也虚：明文密码、权限给太大、没开多因素认证，全被黑客钻了空子。<br /><br />真正该补的课：<br />工具得调教：建好正常行为基线，过滤掉日常噪音。<br />权责得划清：安全人员必须有权直接终端断网，不用层层请示。<br />云和 OT 得盯紧：定期查查过大的应用权限和长期不换的密钥。<br /><br />说白了，光买一堆安全工具没用，关键得有人会用、敢处置。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSgibDPLAOo8I8G1toaaZiccUBpGRBJb029bwKicPRBbAdrWo06uCP1gWiaGJMrOH7Y8JI2Tuln58iatjM0KicicGKVVrkqSDnjX6JEvxY%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSia9BUW3y8YxjvTBPsqxyueguFGfAt1WSfgmaXxw2V2RUSka62OWYtI992I4hib1HBjQwzhHSywY5GADeaMFxBJAmWlHibXVUiaHfE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSgibDPLAOo8I8G1toaaZiccUBpGRBJb029bwKicPRBbAdrWo06uCP1gWiaGJMrOH7Y8JI2Tuln58iatjM0KicicGKVVrkqSDnjX6JEvxY%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-18T06:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497340:1","title":"循环之内：五套从不请求许可的 AI 攻击框架","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497340&idx=1&sn=7d9f269b37c470b649a1ae83d71132f4&chksm=9a9ed45b3c01e12d417341c57f7e3a0ccd4498356ac839d43e1a1943ad52229975d94d129ad1&scene=126&sessionid=1795697936#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSiazFwOCq9RfRCB6AF2h1xQIkTmDBQW2RdlT9RjmwJmAWgy1ntArqE5X6cjRg0d4xqziaeQlv0v6M72eQS1aALj5lRN8tc6XJTCs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T04:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497283:1","title":"我们如何抵御一次 AI 驱动的攻击","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497283&idx=1&sn=32dca74cdac78184474a197dd4b63fe5&chksm=9aa69d6e0f52d97cc79e1b1bc93af13da768d5fe85618400fc7e506bdcbb0ea3da9dd755509f&scene=126&sessionid=1795697936#rd","descr